1
00:00:00,870 --> 00:00:03,000
(Bernadette:)Oh, right.
Did you get your hair cut?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,540
"No. I got them all cut."

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,670
(Bernadette:)Which is still
so funny.

4
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,390
(Raj:)And when you go
to a Chinese restaurant,

5
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:13,710
(Raj:)he always gets the same fortune
in his fortune cookie.

6
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,350
Right. "Help, I'm a prisoner

7
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,350
(Bernadette:)in a Chinese
fortune cookie factory."

8
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:21,450
(Howard:)Okay, I think that's enough
about me.

9
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:23,850
(Raj:)He's right. Let's make
fun of his mother.

10
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:26,890
"Howard, come rub my feet!

11
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:29,590
My corns are killing me!"

12
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:33,330
"Howard, help me
out of the tub!

13
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:35,700
I'm stuck again!"

14
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:41,640
(Leonard:)Coming.

15
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:45,980
(Leonard:)Hey, lovebug.

16
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:48,100
(Penny:)Shut up.

17
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:50,100
(Penny:)You know what I've been doing
for the last hour?

18
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:52,750
(Leonard:)Mm, dreamily doodling
"Mrs. Leonard Hofstadter"

19
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:54,380
(Leonard:)in a notebook?

20
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:56,490
(Penny:)Listening to my father
go on and on

21
00:00:56,490 --> 00:00:57,990
(Penny:)about what a great guy you are.

22
00:00:57,990 --> 00:01:02,020
(Leonard:)You got to admit,
I am... I'm delightful.

